@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Design - migration scope and persistent review
top to bottom direction
class course_scope {
  + choices(profile)
  + capture(profile, key)
}
class migration_planner {
  + preview(..., scopekey)
}
class migration_report {
  + data(..., page, issuepage)
}
class plan_selection {
  + save(planid, digest, visible, included, action)
  + state(planid, visible)
  + digest(planid)
  + manifest_digest(planid)
}
class plan_resolution {
  + apply(planid, digest, kind, id, choice)
}
class pagination {
  + render(total, page, size, url)
}
class migration_executor {
  + queue(planid, digest)
}
plan_resolution --> migration_planner : new reviewed plan
plan_resolution --> plan_selection : preserve exclusions
migration_report --> pagination : bounded pages
migration_planner --> course_scope
migration_planner --> plan_selection : operation fingerprint
migration_executor --> plan_selection : approval validation
migration_report -[hidden]right-> migration_executor
course_scope -[hidden]down-> plan_selection
note bottom of migration_report : Independent bounded file and issue pages.
note bottom of plan_selection : Selection and queueing share one plan lock.
@enduml
